# Generated by tools/build-brand-assets.py
brand/dwcode-railshift-assets.zip
site/downloads/
site/demo/
# site/data/ is build output (themes.json) — except the extension catalog data,
# which is the committed source the published page renders from, so CI's
# `npm run validate:catalog` and an offline `catalog:render` work from a fresh
# clone. Refresh it with `npm run catalog:build` (needs the registry).
site/data/*
!site/data/catalog.json
# …and its machine-readable twin, the install index the app fetches
# (docs/PACK_INDEX.md). Same reasoning: committed so an offline `check` can
# prove page, data, index and artifact checksums still agree.
!site/data/catalog/
!site/data/catalog/**
site/vendor/
dist/
packaging/arch/pkg/
packaging/arch/src/
packaging/arch/*.pkg.tar.zst
packaging/arch/*.tar
